WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.600
Looking for something you won’t find everywhere else?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.000
Step inside Roots & Relics Greenhouse.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.300
Browse antiques, collected pieces,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.800
and unexpected finds for your home.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.600
Take your time. There’s plenty to discover.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.600
Bring a friend, enjoy the greenhouse, and make a day of it.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.800
Come meet Pat and Jennifer, the people behind Roots & Relics.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.800
See our next opening and join our email list

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.200
at rootsandrelicsgreenhouse.com.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.000
We’d love to see you in the greenhouse.
